Cognate with {{cog|de|[[Ahnd]], [[And]]||woe, grief}}, {{cog|da|ånde||breath}}, {{cog|sv|[[anda]], [[ande]]||spirit, breath, wind, ingenuity, intellect}}, {{cog|is|andi||spirit}}, {{cog|sq|ëndë||pleasure, delight}}, {{cog|la|animus||spirit, soul}}. Related to {{m|en|onde}}.

